---
{
  title: "pcp"
}
---
### NAME

    pcp() - Returns 1 if the object is a player, 0 if not.

### SYNOPSIS

    int pcp( object ob );

### DESCRIPTION

    Returns 1 if the object is a player, 0 if not.

### PARAMETERS

    ob  (STD_PLAYER)
        The object to check.

### RETURN VALUES

    (ob is STD_PLAYER) 1 if the object is a player, otherwise 0.
